<title>USA: Gulf South Medical says to buy back stock.</title>
<headline>Gulf South Medical says to buy back stock.</headline>
<dateline>RIDGELAND, Miss. 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gulf South Medical Supply Inc said Tuesday it authorized the open-market purchase of up to 1,000,000 shares of the company's common stock.</p>
<p>The company said purchases would at the discretion of management and would depend on market conditions.</p>
</text>
